<%- include('partials/header', { title: 'About Us', pageCss: 'about.css' }) %>

    <div class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-md-center align-items-md-center" style="margin-top: 50px;">
        <h3 class="text-style"><span style="color: #2D4059;">Why Us ?</span><br></h3>
        <h4 class="mt-1 punchline-style">Designed by <span class="diff-style">Learners</span>, Designed for <span class="diff-style">Learners</span></h4>
    </div>

    <div class="container px-4 text-center rounded-4 border shadow-lg border-4 mt-5" style="border-color: #2D4059 !important; background-color: #F4F4F8; width: 1140px; min-height: 500px;">
        <div class="row gx-5">
            <div class="col mt-5">
                <div class="p-3 mx-auto my-auto">
                    <h3><span class="our-story-style" style="color: #2D4059">Our</span><span style="color: #EA5455;"> Story</span></h3>
                    <p class="our-story-text" style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: left;">This platform is a passion project born from real language learners who wanted a smarter, more aesthetic approach to mastering German. We created this platform because we've been exactly where you are right now—stumbling over complex grammar, staring at dry textbooks, and searching for a better way to make German stick. We knew language learning didn't have to feel like a chore, so we built the tool we always wished we had. This isn't just another app; it's a high-focus, community-driven space designed to take you from your very first Guten Tag to absolute conversational confidence.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col" style="margin-top: 80px;">
                <img src="/images/About-Us-Images/my-people.png" alt="sample-image" class="rounded" style="width: 350px; height: 350px; object-fit: cover;">
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

   <div class="slide-wrapper">
    <div class="container px-4 text-center border shadow-lg border-4 rounded-4" style="margin-top: 250px; border-color: #2D4059 !important; background-color: #F4F4F8; width: 1140px; min-height: 500px;">
        <div class="row gx-5">
            <div class="col" style="margin-top: 70px;">
                <img src="/images/About-Us-Images/about-me.svg" alt="sample-image" class="rounded" style="width: 350px; height: 350px; object-fit: cover;">
            </div>
            <div class="col mt-5">
                <div class="p-3 mx-auto">
                   <h3><span style="color: #2D4059">Note</span><span style="color: #2D4059;"> From</span><span style="color: #EA5455;"> Arinjay</span></h3>
                    <p class="note-text-style" style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: left;">Hey there! I'm Arinjay, a Computer Science undergraduate. I developed this platform because I found learning German quite hard the first time; I procrastinated heavily and even failed once!. The motto behind developing this site was to make German less of a daunting language and more of an interesting hobby. This platform is built from my own learnings and the exact things I struggled with first-hand, so that others don't have to.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    </div>

    <div class="slide-wrapper-two">
    <div class="container px-4 text-center border shadow-lg border-4 rounded-4" style="margin-top: 250px; border-color: #2D4059 !important; background-color: #F4F4F8; width: 1140px; min-height: 500px;">
        <div class="row gx-5">
            <div class="col mt-5">
                <div class="p-3 mx-auto">
                   <h3><span class="our-story-style" style="color: #2D4059">Our</span><span style="color: #EA5455;"> Goal</span></h3>
                    <p class="goal-text-style" style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: left;">Our goal is simple: to make learning German feel less like a difficult subject and more like an enjoyable journey. We want to provide a platform where students can learn at their own pace, understand concepts clearly, and actually enjoy the process. Everything here is designed around making German easier, more engaging, and less overwhelming. We hope this platform helps you stay consistent, build confidence, and turn German into a skill you genuinely enjoy learning.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col mx-auto my-auto">
                <img src="/images/About-Us-Images/our-mission.png" alt="sample-image" class="rounded" style="width: 350px; height: 350px; object-fit: cover;">
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    </div>

<%- include('partials/footer', { pageJs: 'about.js' }) %>
